{"id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-delta2-preservation.md","title":"历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","display":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-delta2-preservation","aliases":["20-lem-delta2-preservation"],"display":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 7.6.2","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-delta2-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-delta2-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 7.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*\">\\(A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 非可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\">\\(|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设最后一次损伤在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 以前，并反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\">\\(\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>，特别 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,s)\\to\\infty\">\\(m(e,s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，有效搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;v\">\\(s&gt;v\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(m(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\\)</span> 停止，返回其输出。该搜索必停止。</p>\n<p>从此以后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,t)\\ge m(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(m(e,t)\\ge m(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span>，所以该输入的固定有限停止 use 在每阶段都仍被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_*(e,t)\">\\(r_*(e,t)\\)</span> 覆盖。无损伤和 use 保持引理归纳保证它永不改变，因而输出等于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(p)=\\chi_C(p)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(p)=\\chi_C(p)\\)</span>。此普通搜索带有限常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 计算了非可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，矛盾。它不需目标位单向变化，正是历史最大值的作用。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 7.6.2；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s,c,C_s,m,r_*","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C.","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"m(e,s)\\to\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"s>v","display":false},{"tex":"m(e,s)>p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"m(e,t)\\ge m(e,s)>p","display":false},{"tex":"r_*(e,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A(p)=\\chi_C(p)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"11bbbd83a4b964cf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-preservation]] — 章 7；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]"}],"outgoing":["02f37a11ca2f55ac","18e11f4651f28406","fec296dc8eb84564"]}